{"v":4,"catch":"我要尋找的虛假愛情故事\n螺旋記憶-我遇到自己的夏天-","desc":"主角\n朝永未來(Asanaga Miku)是一個高中的普通女孩。\n但是她有一個秘密。\n\n記憶力減退。\n\n她上高中之前的記憶完全消失了。\n奇怪的夢想，過度保護的父母，可疑的健忘症……\n尋找未來，等待”未來”的真相是什麼？\n\n其他人物：\n大河内壮介(Sosuke Okochi)　CV: 鈴木裕斗(Yuto Suzuki)\n南方隼人(Hayato Minakata)　CV: 岸尾だいすけ(Daisuke Kishio)\n湯川数馬(Kazuma Yukawa)　CV:興津和幸(Kazuyuki Okitsu)\n岡崎凛(Rin Okazaki)　CV:松岡禎丞(Yoshitsugu Matsuoka)\n\n插圖：\n雙葉早樹 (Hazuki Futaba)","publisher":"DIGIMERCE","release":"2020-07-30","genres":["冒險","模擬"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.5GB / Switch 0.5GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5b50ecda23642c8161df69fb7f6383e2eb488e5738fe6369fddbf78dc41895c9.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/38ac24409191d3b93c5bf3b5d038f009421fb55db841890573aa8975c75f30a3.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/fe0f3f8b14a3bf436bfdc51d792822cb55f4c37bfb92b277a9e1b059d115de2a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/dc85a942a537c4e4e5ae13faeebac7552039a3ee63ae12e4b55926f076dc1142.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a79e60a5a7db2e07d65c2369df24a34abe12d9dc13068d39b53940e7d309a149.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d9ba2e3851547e2fc03b0d8d91621e8efb8abfe5050b8e279fb47eccf7f7690a.jpg"],"titleId":"0100f6d01250c000","demo":["70030000011907"],"dlc":[],"vids":["zk3tpzuvz78"]}